RL-KB-016 test does not prove absence of undiscovered paths, future regressions or risks outside the stated identities, inputs, environment and version.', content_digest='193699a37afbfe2d65e94de1d119816dac7f1a7705c698cb80a0f598753a755c', updated_at='2026-08-06' WHERE entry_id='ARL-KB-016';
